{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1000_p", "source_sha256": "742b380749be89c5acc884435e6718728683e445a92ee91426e545d5c1c22165", "ja": "（奈緒と茜がプロデュースしたイベントが無事終了。\nところで、奈緒の姿が見えないな……どこだ？）", "zh": "（奈绪和茜策划的活动顺利结束了。话说回来，没看到奈绪啊……她去哪儿了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5852ef3ce14d9c1fe6de74a77313e1e669362c434aa9199d658d17146ac139f0", "ja": "奈緒！　探したぞ。何してるんだ？", "zh": "奈绪！找了你好久。在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "660db97cabfc70042cfb733ceb9abccfdfdc13315b0c2b5954e923fcbde3d23b", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nなにって、イベントの片付け手伝ってます。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你问我在做什么？我在帮忙收拾活动现场呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "1503c95462db1a5776211b98a86b1b593d1dae22de6d0ea3c5aa86fdbfc6aa0c", "ja": "ほら、遠足も帰るまでが遠足やないですか？\nそれと同じで、帰るまでがイベントなんです！", "zh": "你看，远足也是直到回去才算结束，不是吗？\n同样的道理，活动也要到回去为止才算结束！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "7e05e53c0db2d545ab0717f5c73b066bc458223d93028955d270af298a288e64", "ja": "なんて言うんでしたっけ？　鳥が……鳥が立って、\n濁さず、みたいな……とにかく、そんな感じで！", "zh": "该怎么说来着？鸟儿……鸟儿飞走了，不留下浑浊之类的……总之，就是那么回事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c2fba3302c3a4543aa366cc984c0f4b37e090f9c0f909bbcbf17edc0d80e7f43", "ja": "立つ鳥跡を濁さず、か？\n要するに、最後までしっかりやりたいって事かな。", "zh": "是“离去的鸟儿不弄浑水”吗？总之，就是想做到有始有终吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "234e3a1bb34557f567cd77d211f7a6ac9ea4970db4486283351eac7cc8994909", "ja": "そう！　それが言いたかったんです！\nわかってますね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "对！我想说的就是这个！\n你很懂嘛，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "eabe02086b13ee1e2141cc24112de1e7cbf9afeb0fe777e116baf95f63bbda75", "ja": "今回、企画から参加させてもらったやないですか？\n準備も宣伝も、茜と一緒に色々させてもらって……。", "zh": "这次不是从企划阶段就让我们参与进来了吗？\n准备和宣传什么的，也和茜一起做了不少……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "42f331d8022b8a8a17d0e7d74c4607f054307c7b8a325d860bbbcd5039ac3084", "ja": "私らにがっつり任せてくれて、\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "谢谢您把这么重要的任务全权交给我们，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c08f6e6b40ed775b41dab1740292b91a8e5ae7dd0fc9167f251efe3d43068bde", "ja": "それは、ふたりなら大丈夫だと思ったからな。\nいい思い出になったみたいでよかった。", "zh": "因为我觉得交给你们两个人肯定没问题。\n能成为一段美好的回忆，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "17d392321012f14f63f95e512d0cd9883cf1863717e905cc644ac68b032c2efe", "ja": "そうですね。\nせやから、最後までちゃんとしたいって思ったのかも。", "zh": "是啊。所以，我可能才会觉得，想好好坚持到最后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "d30a66107fee2f6a8c64e0e28f1e942177295052a1370657d25ca112ab49c99d", "ja": "本番が終わって終了やなくて、\n作った人間としては、最後まで見届けたいなって。", "zh": "不是正式演出结束了就算完，作为亲手打造这一切的人，我想看到最后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "eb22dd1e65cf232600f60ca47c6d34c2289efdf75646cd6e530cc261eba684ba", "ja": "名残惜しいですけど、それも私らが頑張った証拠やって\n思えて……せやから片付け、やらせてください！", "zh": "虽然很不舍，但我觉得这也是我们努力过的证明\n……所以收拾会场的工作，请务必让我来做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5307bd5fec43d89eed2afa8c9a2e89008a2b5cb93b5eb2bb5d5fbe30138acbc4", "ja": "ああ、凄くいい事だと思うよ。\nただ、衣装は着替えてからにして欲しいな。", "zh": "啊，我觉得这是件非常好的事。\n不过，我希望你先换好服装再做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "e77acd8e83aee7ed631552ac483f93b41fc649b80fc4327fdef94ae1b021c8d2", "ja": "えっ？　……ああっ！？\n着替えるん忘れてました！　アカンやん！", "zh": "咦？……啊！？\n我忘了换衣服啦！这下糟了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "9ea245a10be00d5860aac027fdf235d50b753e633630e46c2bc4ef09f312092a", "ja": "え、えへへ……それだけ自然に着られる衣装やって\nことで！　すぐ着替えて来ますから……。", "zh": "诶、诶嘿嘿……就是说，这套服装穿起来太自然了！\n我马上去换……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1017_null", "source_sha256": "8d672fc290e4f5bb608e77c9c513ae831b878bcdb2a9947dcc94a54988e63289", "ja": "ブーッ！　ブーッ！", "zh": "哔──！哔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "c41c60ac58a8b30f5cce156d4cb195a763540d8ae4463b89ec41835e60fa634e", "ja": "あれ？　茜からメッセージが……\nあ、アカン！　SNS用の写真、撮る約束してたんや！", "zh": "咦？茜发了消息过来……\n啊，糟了！我和她约好要拍发社交媒体的照片的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1019_p", "source_sha256": "202e4f286ca7d2cc260b28ca161d77dc290d6fb36175b79c95235e5811a8d51f", "ja": "それなら急いだ方が……だいぶ片付けも進んでるし。\nこうなると、着替えてなくてよかったな。", "zh": "既然这样，还是快点去吧……收拾也已经进行得差不多了。\n这么一来，还好没来得及换衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "c913ce624a455e8fcf4fa87a6fb241e8e3f93c43577533e45bbae22a4ebdf328", "ja": "そ、そうですね！　私、ダッシュで呼んできます！\n{$P$}さん、ここは任せました～！", "zh": "那、那倒也是！我这就跑去把人叫来！\n{$P$}先生，这里就拜托你啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0274_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6b3a16e43783f285964e8ce8f065eb93a3c77de41435b2fe567ce18485722e8c", "ja": "（最後までバタバタするのが、なんとも奈緒らしい。\nいい思い出で終われるよう、協力しないとな！）", "zh": "（最后还在手忙脚乱，真是很有奈绪的风格。为了能以美好的回忆收尾，我也得帮忙才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
